What kind of dreams would I accumulate...

00:28:22.150 --> 00:28:31.100
...what kind of love would I go through...

00:28:32.710 --> 00:28:42.900
 ...if I were to reach that light ?

00:28:58.350 --> 00:29:03.250
Preview of Next Episode

00:29:00.700 --> 00:29:05.950
In Imperial Year 486, Reinhard, who had become a vice admiral at the age of 19...

00:29:05.950 --> 00:29:10.300
...took a part in the Imperial Force's invasion into the Alliance territory.

00:29:10.300 --> 00:29:14.070
But people were cold toward the 
commander whom they deemed too young...

00:29:14.070 --> 00:29:17.950
...and it looked as though he would not be given a chance to make his mark, but...

00:29:17.950 --> 00:29:18.950
Next episode of...

00:29:18.350 --> 00:29:29.950
Legend of the Galactic Heroes Gaiden

00:29:18.350 --> 00:29:29.950
"The Third Battle of Tiamat"
Part 1

00:29:23.600 --> 00:29:27.600
Now, the curtain of a
grand epic will be raised.
